.PS
# The lossy line of vignette("lines"): a 1 V edge through Rs into 24
# units of line ending in Rl.
N1: (0,1.5)
N2: (1.4,1.5)
N3: (3.8,1.5)

V1: vsource(N1, (0,0), PWL(0 0 1n 0 2n 1), "V1")
Rs: resistor(N1, N2, R_S, "Rs")
O1: ltraline(N2, N3, LL)
Rl: resistor(N3, (3.8,0), R_L, "Rl")

line from O1.N1 to (O1.N1.x,0)
line from O1.N2 to (O1.N2.x,0)
line from V1.N to Rl.N
dot at (O1.N1.x,0); dot at (O1.N2.x,0); dot at N2; dot at N3
"1" above at N1 + (0,0.05)
"2" above at N2 + (0,0.05)
"3" above at N3 + (0,0.05)
ground((1.2,0))
.PE
